# Upload
### Foto do usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/pessoas/upload-picture
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----BoundaryDelimitadorHttp
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

------BoundaryDelimitadorHttp
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="imagem.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./dev/images/imagem.png
------BoundaryDelimitadorHttp--
### Ver foto
GET {{baseUrl}}/pictures/18.png